& [Need]
  + corrective P1 cannot consume a nested candidate and cannot create its own candidate without laundering preparation into observation authority
  + a published carrier now contains the exact verifier and tracked sentinels needed by one external clean linked worktree

& [SmallestEffect]
  + one absent scratch root one exact local branch one Git worktree metadata entry and one 0.03 GiB carrier checkout are sufficient
  + no clone object duplication remote fetch provider model App Server or candidate authorship is needed

& [RiskControl]
  + pre-effect drift is zero-contact NotRun while uncertainty after effect retains Quarantined state for THEBRAIN\enjer
  + no cleanup retry force branch deletion or worktree removal can hide partial mutation
  + exact environment process and free-space bounds prevent ambient Git policy or storage pressure from widening the effect

& [Value]
  + a verified preparation receipt gives later Phase3A a real external candidate without claiming Phase3A freshness
  + the seam moves SWA-05 toward an enforceable local self-work host while preserving P1 B2 and activation as separate gates
